@node Environment
@chapter Environment

@cindex environment variables
@vtable @env
@item CGRA_DEVICE
Default device when @option{-d} is absent.
@item CGRA_PORT
Override the resolved profile's serial port.
@item CGRA_BAUD
Override the resolved profile's baud rate.
@item CGRA_PATH
Colon-separated list of extra configuration roots, searched like @env{PATH}
(also used for @code{include} resolution).
@item CGRA_CONFIG
Project-local configuration file, loaded instead of @file{./.cgra/}.
@item CGRA_STDLIB
Source directory @command{cgra init} copies the standard library from (before
the configured installed directory and the relative source directories
@file{sw/config/stdlib}, @file{config/stdlib}). An explicit nonempty value
that cannot supply the library is an error. This variable affects
@command{init}; use @env{CGRA_PATH} to add include search directories.
@item XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Base for the user config directory (@file{$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cgra}); falls back to
@file{~/.config/cgra}.
@end vtable
